  "description": "The component CATALOG of a Skill pebble (a reusable PROCEDURE the AI runs, exposed as a /slash-command): each content component and WHAT belongs under it — purpose, whenToUse, arguments, prerequisites, tools, steps, constraints, verify, onFailure, output, examples — plus the skill-vs-agent distinction, what a skill references (rules + knowledge), that it has no resources, and every skill-related pebbles-cli command. A DEFINITION reference skills point at.",
